@subsection Supported Constructs
All canonical constructs fully supported.

@subsection Excluded Constructs
@strong{Stack comment nodes:} Forth's stack comments (e.g., @code{( n n -- n )}) do not generate AST nodes. Justification: Comments are compile-time metadata only, not runtime code.

@subsection Proposed Syntax for Missing Constructs
None.

