@subsection Excluded Constructs
@strong{Game engine features (actors, rooms, objects):} SCUMM's actors, rooms, objects, and constants compile to variable assignments + library calls, not preserved as special AST nodes. Justification: Game semantics are engine-specific; canonical AST is computation-agnostic. Resolution: @code{ACTOR 1 actorName} → @code{(:call :target "SetActor" :library t :using 1 actorName)}.

@subsection Proposed Syntax for Missing Constructs
